   "source": [
    "# set dataset Paths\n",
    "LEGIT_HEADER_IWSPA_PATH = \"https://anti-phish.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/iwspa_legit_header.csv\"\n",
    "PHISHING_HEADER_IWSPA_PATH = \"https://anti-phish.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/iwspa_phish_header.csv\"\n",
    "\n",
    "PHISHING_HEADER_NAZARIO_PATH = (\n",
    "    \"https://anti-phish.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/nazario_phish_header.csv\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "LEGIT_NO_HEADER_IWSPA_PATH = (\n",
    "    \"https://anti-phish.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/iwspa_legit_no_header.csv\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "PHISHING_NO_HEADER_IWSPA_PATH = (\n",
    "    \"https://anti-phish.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/iwspa_phish_no_header.csv\"\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "375f54dd-8c65-4962-994c-db43a4c9d069",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "375f54dd-8c65-4962-994c-db43a4c9d069"
   },
   "source": [
    "The subset of labeled emails without a header will be used as a way to compare the different Machine Learning techniques by evaluating each model's accuracy in identifying phishing emails that have no header, after being trained on emails with full headers."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c1e40698-37c7-4478-a8b4-1116e2260cce",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "c1e40698-37c7-4478-a8b4-1116e2260cce"
   },
   "source": [
